<v Speaker 2>The prophet gave an explicit direct command to his men to hold a mountain pass.

197
00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.310
<v Speaker 2>It wasn't a suggestion.

198
00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:56.270
<v Speaker 2>It was a military and spiritual directive.

199
00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:02.190
<v Speaker 2>The historical record, which all sides acknowledge, shows that Umar abandoned his position.

