00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:32.270
<v Speaker 2>The chaos at Hunain is a microcosm of the entire conflict over succession.

206
00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.750
<v Speaker 2>True authority is not proven by standing near the leader in moments of peace.

