<v Speaker 2>It occurred in a place called Ghadir Qom.

232
00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:18.270
<v Speaker 2>Returning from his farewell pilgrimage, the Prophet physically halted the entire caravan.

233
00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.190
