00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:24.030
<v Speaker 2>He took the first imam by the hand and publicly established his authority.

235
00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.630
<v Speaker 1>He performed the exact same act that Noah performed for Sham.

236
00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:33.870
<v Speaker 2>It was a clear verbal designation, eliminating any need or justification for the community to convene and hold a vote.

237
00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:37.710
<v Speaker 2>The naming was explicit and it was done in the open light of day.

238
00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:40.670
<v Speaker 1>This is where the author's method becomes truly devastating.

239
00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:47.150
<v Speaker 1>He turns to the historical record of the men who actually assumed power, analyzing the words they spoke from the pulpit.

240
00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:55.110
